    "releaseDate": null,
    "description": "Technology Add-on that parses, normalizes and CIM-maps WALLIX Bastion Privileged Access Management syslog events. Supports both WALLIX syslog dialects (modern RFC 5424 double-quoted key=\"value\" and legacy WAB(CORE) single-quoted key='value'). Search-time knowledge only: no scripts, no third-party libraries, no compiled binaries.",
